{
  "name": "14 · Invoice Chaser (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Finance)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 💸 Invoice Chaser – polite reminders that get firmer\nEvery night at 9 PM: read your invoices sheet → find unpaid invoices past their due date → Claude writes a reminder whose tone matches how late it is (1-7 days friendly, 8-21 days firm, 22+ days final notice) → Gmail sends it → the sheet is updated so nobody gets two emails in one day.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheet with headers: Invoice No, Client, Contact name, Email, Amount, Due date, Status, Reminders sent, Last reminder. Due date as YYYY-MM-DD. Status = Paid stops the reminders.\n2. **Read invoices** + **Update sheet**: connect Google Sheets and pick that sheet.\n3. **Claude**: add your Anthropic API key. Put your business name in the prompt.\n4. **Send reminder**: connect Gmail.\n5. Test with your own email in the sheet first, then Activate.\n\n---\nPart of **MAP – 12 AI agents** (Kaamchor AI).",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "bfa5b1f5-998b-49bc-8690-1932a321025d",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -320,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 21
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d6a7d5c3-a2a2-4af8-8fba-03d0cd79fd70",
      "name": "Every night 9 PM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
